<Page title="Website privacy." description="This ArtemisKit website is a static documentation and information site by Vorbtech Innovative Solutions. Its code does not include a signup database, advertising trackers or a hosted AI chat. Links to GitHub and other external services take you to those services, where their own privacy practices apply." eyebrow="Website information"><h2>What happens in your browser?</h2><p>Documentation search uses the site's local search index. Documentation theme preferences may be stored in your browser. The illustrative homepage examples do not send prompts to a model.</p><h2>What may be handled by hosting?</h2><p>The VPS or any configured reverse proxy/CDN may process ordinary request information, including IP address, requested path and technical diagnostics. Logging and retention depend on the actual hosting configuration and must be confirmed before production launch.</p><h2>What about assessment requests?</h2><p>The current application link opens a public GitHub issue. Do not submit credentials, personal data, production records or proprietary documents there. Sensitive scoping needs an agreed private channel and separate data-handling terms.</p><h2>What about running the toolkit?</h2><p>Provider calls from your own toolkit deployment are separate from visiting this website. Review your provider configuration, storage and evidence-retention settings before running tests.</p><h2>Questions and updates</h2><p>Use the contact details published on the <a href="https://www.vorbtech.com.ng/">official Vorbtech website</a>. This page describes the prepared site's behaviour as of 24 October 2026. Production hosting details must be reconciled before cutover.</p></Page>
